§§ `ss 196-200 - punished as if false evidence`

`certificate issued in a judicial proceeding` MEANS `Using False Evidence Facts` WITH
    particulars IS `the particulars`
    `uses or attempts to use as true or genuine evidence any evidence` IS FALSE
    `corruptly` IS FALSE
    `knows the evidence to be false or fabricated` IS FALSE
    `issues or signs any certificate` IS TRUE
    `the certificate is required by law to be given or signed` IS TRUE
    `the certificate relates to a fact of which it is by law admissible in evidence` IS FALSE
    `knowing or believing that the certificate is false in any material point` IS TRUE
    `uses or attempts to use the certificate as a true certificate` IS FALSE
    `knowing the certificate to be false in any material point` IS FALSE
    `makes a statement in a declaration made or subscribed by him` IS FALSE
    `a court of justice, public servant or other person is bound or authorised by law to receive the declaration as evidence of any fact` IS FALSE
    `the statement in the declaration is false` IS FALSE
    `knows or believes the statement in the declaration to be false or does not believe it to be true` IS FALSE
    `touching any point material to the object for which the declaration is made or used` IS FALSE
    `uses or attempts to use as true any such declaration` IS FALSE
    `knowing the declaration to be false in any material point` IS FALSE
    `in any stage of a judicial proceeding` IS TRUE
    `what was used or made` IS ""

