#ASSERT (`charge under s 285` `cigarette dropped, fire 45 minutes later`)'s punishment EQUALS "imprisonment for a term which may extend to one year, or with fine which may extend to $5,000, or with both"
-- s 286: "within 60 minutes from the time of that act"
#ASSERT `within 60 minutes` 45
#ASSERT `within 60 minutes` 60
#ASSERT NOT `within 60 minutes` 61

§§ `ss 292-294 - obscenity`

`obscene act on a bus` MEANS `Obscenity Facts` WITH
    particulars IS `the particulars`
    `the object is an obscene object` IS FALSE
    `the dealing is authorised by or under any written law` IS FALSE
    `the object is kept or used bona fide for religious purposes` IS FALSE
    `sells, lets to hire, distributes, publicly exhibits or puts into circulation the obscene object` IS FALSE
    `makes, produces or has in his possession the obscene object for the purposes of sale, hire, distribution, public exhibition or circulation` IS FALSE
    `imports, exports or conveys the obscene object for those purposes, or knowing or having reason to believe it will be so dealt with` IS FALSE
    `takes part in, or receives profits from, a business in which he knows or has reason to believe obscene objects are so made or dealt with` IS FALSE
    `advertises or makes known that a person is engaged or ready to engage in such an act, or that an obscene object can be procured from or through any person` IS FALSE
    `offers or attempts to do any such act` IS FALSE
    `by electronic means, to 10 or more individuals` IS FALSE
    `the object depicts an image of a person who is, appears to a reasonable observer to be, or is implied to be, below 18 years of age` IS FALSE
    `on 2 or more occasions, sells, lets to hire, distributes, publicly exhibits or circulates by electronic means an obscene object to a total of 10 or more individuals` IS FALSE
    `imports, exports, conveys, sells, lets to hire, distributes, puts into circulation, makes, produces or is in possession of a child sex-doll` IS FALSE
    `an obscene object is sold, let for hire, distributed, publicly exhibited or circulated to 10 or more individuals on an online location` IS FALSE
    `develops, maintains, organises, manages, supervises, regulates membership of or access to, or exercises editorial control over, the online location` IS FALSE
    `intended that the online location be used to enable or facilitate the sale, hire, distribution, public exhibition or circulation of obscene objects generally` IS FALSE
    `sells, lets to hire, distributes, exhibits or circulates, or offers or attempts to do so, an obscene object to a person` IS FALSE
    `the person is below 21 years of age` IS FALSE
    `to the annoyance of others` IS TRUE
    `does any obscene act in any public place` IS TRUE
    `sings, recites or utters any obscene words in or near any public place` IS FALSE
    `what was done` IS ""

